4. YCB Object and Model Set
----------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) Yale University, Carnegie Mellon University,
              University of California Berkeley
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
         for the dataset; MIT License for the accompanying code
Project: https://www.ycbbenchmarks.com/
Full license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Citation:
  B. Calli, A. Walsman, A. Singh, S. Srinivasa, P. Abbeel, A. M. Dollar,
  "Benchmarking in Manipulation Research: Using the Yale-CMU-Berkeley
  Object and Model Set", IEEE Robotics & Automation Magazine,
  vol. 22, no. 3, pp. 36-52, 2015.

STATUS: The tennis ball object model (056_tennis_ball, google_16k) is
INCLUDED in this repository under assets/ycb/ and assets/sphere/default/ycb/.
CHANGES MADE: convex decomposition meshes for simulation (V-HACD) and
URDF wrappers were generated from the original scan data. The original
mesh and texture data are otherwise unaltered.

